WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,770
It doesn't matter. I mean you explain the matter carefully and I'll see what happens.

2
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:12,050
Well, uncle, when I first met the supervisor, he spoke in a strange manner. I tolerated it at first, and then came up with ways to improve wild love.

3
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:17,050
But that supervisor not only ignored me and asked me to get out, but also directly scolded me and told me to get out.

4
00:00:17,050 --> 00:00:20,310
Did you show him the official document I wrote to you?

5
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:24,830
I went in and took a look. When he told me to get out, he said it was useless for me to be here, uncle.

6
00:00:24,830 --> 00:00:27,030
Okay, good for you, Sun Yun.

7
00:00:27,620 --> 00:00:32,200
Uncle Master, Xiaozhi, I heard that Sun Jianzheng is from Prince Su.

8
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:37,120
But Xiaozhi and I have been busy with Tianxian Sin recently, and I haven't offended them with the matter with Cao Yun.

9
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:40,040
Why do I feel like he is deliberately targeting me?

10
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:44,710
Master, what's wrong? What's the problem?

11
00:00:44,710 --> 00:00:50,090
It is said that Cao Yun's incident has something to do with Prince Su.

12
00:00:50,090 --> 00:00:54,110
No wonder the old man is targeting me, feeling that behind Cao Yun is really Prince Su.

13
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:58,740
It was just a rumor before, but now it seems that it is almost the same.

14
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:01,860
Now it seems that the name thing is not feasible.

15
00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:03,860
What are you going to do next?
